  "description": "Test build of Qiyana as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Qiyana so Terrashape takes her element from the terrain beside her where Audacity lands (brush gives grass, a wall or the map's edge rock, the river river; with none near, the fight picks: grass to slip away when she is low, rock on a wounded champion, river to hold any other, rock on monsters and minions), Royal Privilege's first-hit bonus counts each enemy on its own, and Edge of Ixtal's rock hits harder only on enemies under half health. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
